   495|                <h2>1. The Three-Tier Hospital System</h2>
   496|                
   497|                <p>China's healthcare system is organized into a <strong>three-tier structure</strong>, designed to efficiently distribute medical resources and manage patient flow. Understanding this system is crucial for international patients seeking quality care.</p>
   498|                
   499|                <div class="info-box">
   500|                    <h4>💡 Why This Matters for You</h4>
   501|                    <p>As an international patient, you'll likely be referred to <strong>Tier 3 hospitals</strong> — the top medical institutions with the best specialists, equipment, and international patient services. These are where world-class treatment happens in China.</p>
   502|                </div>
   503|                
   504|                <h3>Tier 1: Community Health Centers</h3>
   505|                <p>These are neighborhood-level facilities handling common illnesses, preventive care, and basic services. They serve as the first point of contact for minor health issues and manage chronic disease follow-ups.</p>
   506|                
   507|                <h3>Tier 2: District/Regional Hospitals</h3>
   508|                <p>Medium-sized hospitals serving a specific district or city area. They have more specialized departments and can handle complex cases that community centers cannot. Many have decent international patient experience.</p>
   509|                
   510|                <h3>Tier 3: Tertiary Hospitals (Your Target)</h3>
   511|                <p>The top tier — provincial or national-level hospitals with comprehensive medical capabilities. These institutions:</p>
   512|                <ul style="margin: 15px 0 20px 25px;">
   513|                    <li>Have the most experienced specialists (often trained internationally)</li>
   514|                    <li>Own cutting-edge equipment (Da Vinci surgery, Proton therapy, etc.)</li>
   515|                    <li>Conduct medical research and clinical trials</li>
   516|                    <li>Accept referrals from lower-tier hospitals</li>
   517|                    <li>Offer dedicated international patient departments</li>
   518|                </ul>
   519|                
   520|                <div class="info-box warning">
   521|                    <h4>⚠️ Important Distinction</h4>
